msgctxt "539"
msgid ""
"A popular 24-pack of assorted Okinawan chinsuko\n"
"cookies. They come in plain, mango, sweet potato,\n"
"brown sugar, coconut, and pineapple flavors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "682"
msgid ""
"A 24-pack of plain Okinawan chinsuko cookies. I hear\n"
"they make good souvenirs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "761"
msgid ""
"100％ natural shikwasa fruit juice, found only here in\n"
"Okinawa. It tastes a bit like lemon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "854"
msgid ""
"Shikwasa candy is a refreshing citrus candy made\n"
"with all-natural ingredients. No artificial coloring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "957"
msgid ""
"This candy is made of turmeric. It's got a pretty \n"
"mellow taste, but it's a natural stimulant. No artificial\n"
"ingredients or coloring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1091"
msgid ""
"Okinawa's famous goya in candy form with no\n"
"artificial colors or additives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1167"
msgid ""
"This soba's got four distinct flavors, and all of them \n"
"are distinctly Okinawan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid ""
"Okinawan soba and tender pork rib meat. The ultimate\n"
"local combination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid ""
"Now you can take authentic Okinawan soba with you\n"
"on the go. I'm sure you'll enjoy the authentic noodles\n"
"and broth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "Everyone loves this Okinawan original."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1475"
msgid ""
"This vinegar is a byproduct of awamori's production\n"
"process. It's much less sour than other vinegars, and\n"
"it's rich in citric and amino acids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1618"
msgid ""
"A 500 mL bottle of mineral water that's straight from\n"
"Okinawa's natural springs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1699"
msgid ""
"Nothing quenches your thirst quite like a bottle of \n"
"sanpin tea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1764"
msgid ""
"A 32-pack of cookies made with real shikwasa, a \n"
"tropical citrus fruit found in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1853"
msgid ""
"A 10-pack of mini cheesecakes made with rich cheese\n"
"and shikwasa, a tropical citrus fruit found in Okinawa. "
msgstr ""